Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: libnss3, libatk1.0-0, libcups2, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxrandr2, libgbm1, libasound2, fcitx5
Description: Thorium Browser (AVX2 & RIME IME Optimized Edition)
 Thorium Browser compiled specifically for Intel Haswell/Broadwell/Skylake
 and AMD Zen 1-3 CPUs supporting 256-bit AVX2, FMA3, and BMI2 instructions.
 Full integration with RIME/Fcitx5 Chinese input method and VA-API acceleration.
